{"type":"message","id":"64296da7","parentId":"40d418c1","timestamp":"2026-05-24T04:35:36.364Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Git is already installed (v2.39.5). We need:\n1. SSH client (for `git push` via SSH)\n2. gh CLI\n\nSince we can't use elevated apt, the best approach is to use the `host=\"gateway\"` option to run on the host, or download precompiled binaries.\n\nActually, let me try `host=\"gateway\"` - this means the command would run on the gateway host rather than in the sandbox/container.\n\nWait, but the gateway IS the container itself. Let me think...\n\nActually, looking at the exec options more carefully:\n- `host` can be \"auto\", \"sandbox\", \"gateway\", \"node\"\n- \"gateway\" would run on the gateway host\n- \"sandbox\" is the isolated sandbox\n\nSince we're already running inside the OpenClaw gateway container, `host=\"gateway\"` would still be the same container. The issue is lacking root.\n\nLet me instead download the binaries manually:\n1. gh CLI - download the tar.gz from GitHub releases\n2. SSH - download a static build of OpenSSH\n\nOr actually, for the SSH use case, if we just need `git push` via SSH, we can use `GIT_SSH_COMMAND` with any SSH client, or use the HTTP protocol with a GitHub token.\n\nActually, simpler approach: since git is already installed, we can use HTTPS with a GitHub token for git operations. And gh can be downloaded as a precompiled binary.\n\nBut the user might specifically want SSH keys. Let me just download both and get them set up.\n\nLet me try another approach - can I use the fact that this is a container? Maybe I can write to /tmp and install there.\n\nActually wait - the user is asking how to install these. Maybe I should just give them the commands and let them know they need root access via the container's host, or suggest downloading static binaries. But as an agent, I should try to actually do it.\n\nLet me download static binaries.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Git 已装，就差 SSH 和 gh。无 root，走静态"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7b8783cbf3ae4b17b31852c2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p ~/.local/bin && cd /tmp\n\n# --- gh CLI 静态二进制 ---\necho \"=== Downloading gh CLI ===\"\ncurl -sL https://github.com/cli/cli/releases/download/v2.67.0/gh_2.67.0_linux_amd64.tar.gz -o gh.tar.gz\ntar xzf gh.tar.gz\ncp gh_2.67.0_linux_amd64/bin/gh ~/.local/bin/\nchmod +x ~/.local/bin/gh\necho \"gh version:\"\n~/.local/bin/gh --version\n\n# --- SSH 静态二进制 ---\necho \"=== Downloading static ssh ===\"\nif [ -f /usr/bin/ssh ]; then\n  echo \"ssh already exists\"\nelse\n  # Use musl-based static build\n  curl -sL https://github.com/ariadne/static-openssh/releases/download/v9.9p1/openssh-v9.9p1-linux-amd64.tar.xz -o /tmp/ssh.tar.xz 2>/dev/null || \\\n  curl -sL https://github.com/AlexxxIT/StaticSSH/releases/download/v9.6p1/ssh -o ~/.local/bin/ssh 2>/dev/null\n  if [ -f /tmp/ssh.tar.xz ]; then\n    tar xf /tmp/ssh.tar.xz -C /tmp 2>/dev/null\n    find /tmp -name 'ssh' -type f -exec cp {} ~/.local/bin/ssh \\; 2>/dev/null\n  fi\n  chmod +x ~/.local/bin/ssh 2>/dev/null\n  echo \"ssh: $(~/.local/bin/ssh -V 2>&1)\"\nfi\n\n# --- 确保 PATH ---\nexport PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"\necho \"=== Final check ===\"\nwhich gh 2>/dev/null && gh --version\necho \"\"\nwhich ssh 2>/dev/null && ssh -V 2>&1 || echo \"ssh not found in PATH\"","timeout":60},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"mkdir -p ~/.local/bin && cd /tmp\\n\\n# --- gh CLI 静态二进制 ---\\necho \\\"=== Downloading gh CLI ===\\\"\\ncurl -sL https://github.com/cli/cli/releases/download/v2.67.0/gh_2.67.0_linux_amd64.tar.gz -o gh.tar.gz\\ntar xzf gh.tar.gz\\ncp gh_2.67.0_linux_amd64/bin/gh ~/.local/bin/\\nchmod +x ~/.local/bin/gh\\necho \\\"gh version:\\\"\\n~/.local/bin/gh --version\\n\\n# --- SSH 静态二进制 ---\\necho \\\"=== Downloading static ssh ===\\\"\\nif [ -f /usr/bin/ssh ]; then\\n  echo \\\"ssh already exists\\\"\\nelse\\n  # Use musl-based static build\\n  curl -sL https://github.com/ariadne/static-openssh/releases/download/v9.9p1/openssh-v9.9p1-linux-amd64.tar.xz -o /tmp/ssh.tar.xz 2>/dev/null || \\\\\\n  curl -sL https://github.com/AlexxxIT/StaticSSH/releases/download/v9.6p1/ssh -o ~/.local/bin/ssh 2>/dev/null\\n  if [ -f /tmp/ssh.tar.xz ]; then\\n    tar xf /tmp/ssh.tar.xz -C /tmp 2>/dev/null\\n    find /tmp -name 'ssh' -type f -exec cp {} ~/.local/bin/ssh \\\\; 2>/dev/null\\n  fi\\n  chmod +x ~/.local/bin/ssh 2>/dev/null\\n  echo \\\"ssh: $(~/.local/bin/ssh -V 2>&1)\\\"\\nfi\\n\\n# --- 确保 PATH ---\\nexport PATH=\\\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\\\"\\necho \\\"=== Final check ===\\\"\\nwhich gh 2>/dev/null && gh --version\\necho \\\"\\\"\\nwhich ssh 2>/dev/null && ssh -V 2>&1 || echo \\\"ssh not found in PATH\\\"\", \"timeout\": 60}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779597273539,"responseId":"28ee5ee453bd4673927b4f1cdfbe29a8"}}
