{"type":"message","id":"2d9909c0","parentId":"88b3ae91","timestamp":"2026-05-24T04:36:47.927Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"gh CLI installed successfully. SSH static binary download failed (the URLs I tried don't work). Let me try other approaches for getting SSH working in a container without root.\n\nFor SSH, a few options:\n1. Try another static build source\n2. The container might already have SSH via the Docker image's underlying libraries - check if libssl is available\n3. We can use git with https instead of ssh - GitHub supports HTTPS git operations with a PAT\n4. Use `dropbear` static binary instead of OpenSSH\n\nActually, for GitHub backup tasks, the simplest approach is:\n- gh CLI already handles auth via token\n- For git operations, we can use HTTPS URLs with the gh auth token, OR\n- If SSH is absolutely needed, we can try a different static build\n\nLet me try another static SSH source.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"gh 装好了，SSH 静态下载"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3029d081e10f47ff8b3ca2cb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /tmp\n# 试试从 alpine 拿静态 ssh\ncurl -sL https://dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org/alpine/v3.21/main/x86_64/openssh-client-common-9.9_p2-r0.apk -o ssh.apk\ntar xzf ssh.apk 2>/dev/null && find . -name 'ssh' -type f 2>/dev/null\necho \"---\"\n# 或者直接用 node 的 ssh2 模块\nnode -e \"try{require('ssh2');console.log('ssh2 module available')}catch(e){console.log('no ssh2')}\"\necho \"---\"\n# 检查 libc 环境\nldd --version 2>&1 | head -2","timeout":30},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"cd /tmp\\n# 试试从 alpine 拿静态 ssh\\ncurl -sL https://dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org/alpine/v3.21/main/x86_64/openssh-client-common-9.9_p2-r0.apk -o ssh.apk\\ntar xzf ssh.apk 2>/dev/null && find . -name 'ssh' -type f 2>/dev/null\\necho \\\"---\\\"\\n# 或者直接用 node 的 ssh2 模块\\nnode -e \\\"try{require('ssh2');console.log('ssh2 module available')}catch(e){console.log('no ssh2')}\\\"\\necho \\\"---\\\"\\n# 检查 libc 环境\\nldd