{"type":"message","id":"b8f8c8a3","parentId":"57cba03d","timestamp":"2026-05-24T04:41:02.636Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait, those are from the sid repo. For Debian 12 (bookworm), the package should be from the bookworm repository. But the current sources.list points to snapshot repos. Let me try a different approach.\n\nActually, for this container environment, maybe the simplest path is:\n1. gh is already installed ✓\n2. For SSH, instead of installing a binary, we can use npm to install `ssh2` or use Node.js's built-in crypto for key handling\n\nBut wait - the user needs SSH for `git push` to GitHub. Git on its own can use HTTPS with a token, or SSH. Let me check if git supports HTTPS transport.\n\nGit uses HTTPS by default via libcurl. So actually, we can just use HTTPS with a GitHub token (or gh CLI's auth) for git operations. No SSH binary needed!\n\nLet me suggest the path:\n1. ✅ gh CLI - already installed at ~/.local/bin/gh\n2. For SSH → actually not strictly needed if we use HTTPS auth\n3. Configure gh auth login → use gh auth token for git operations\n4. Or use git with HTTPS + token\n\nLet me test if git can do HTTPS clone/push.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8c8fd33a9533413d8c3db6cb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 检查 git 能否走 HTTPS\ngit -c http.version=HTTP/2 ls-remote https://github.com 2>&1 | head -3\necho \"---\"\n# curl 是否可用\nwhich curl && curl --version | head -1\necho \"---\"\n# 确认 gh path 持久化\necho \"export PATH=\\\"\\$HOME/.local/bin:\\$PATH\\\"\" >> ~/.bashrc\nsource ~/.bashrc\necho \"gh: $(which gh)\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"# 检查 git 能否走 HTTPS\\ngit -c http.version=HTTP/2 ls-remote https://github.com 2>&1 | head -3\\necho \\\"---\\\"\\n# curl 是否可用\\nwhich curl && curl --version | head -1\\necho \\\"---\\\"\\n# 确认 gh path 持久化\\necho \\\"export PATH=\\\\\\\"\\\\$HOME/.local/bin:\\\\$PATH\\\\\\\"\\\" >> ~/.bashrc\\nsource ~/.bashrc\\necho \\\"gh: $(which gh)\\\"\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779597540074,"responseId":"6ce5155f05534ae58ddb1612c5696a1c"}}
