{"type":"message","id":"94c6b2a0","parentId":"1edbec5b","timestamp":"2026-05-24T04:42:44.080Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me try a different approach. I can try to extract the deb with ar since dpkg-deb isn't working with it either. Or better yet, let me check if curl with libssh2 is sufficient for git over SSH. Actually, curl has libssh2, which means git can use libssh2 for SSH transport without needing the ssh binary!\n\nLet me check what git is using for SSH transport.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b7126fb9b51940d886657692","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# git 的 SSH 传输模式\ngit -c core.sshCommand=which version 2>&1\n# git 默认 SSH 命令\nGIT_SSH_COMMAND=\"echo\" git fetch 2>&1 | head -3\n# 检查 git 的 SSH 后端\ngit --exec-path\necho \"---\"\n# 看看 git 有无 libssh2 支持\ngit version --build-options 2>&1 | grep -i ssh"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"# git 的 SSH 传输模式\\ngit -c core.sshCommand=which version 2>&1\\n# git 默认 SSH 命令\\nGIT_SSH_COMMAND=\\\"echo\\\" git fetch 2>&1 | head -3\\n# 检查 git 的 SSH 后端\\ngit --exec-path\\necho \\\"---\\\"\\n# 看看 git 有无 libssh2 支持\\ngit version --build-options 2>&1 | grep -i ssh\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779597734073,"responseId":"7ed48027d709475a9e9f43fe592a972a"}}
